OPNsense writes every template at boot, before the rc.d scripts start: the tunnel client starts
only with the switch on (the model's default without a setting) and a tunnel the agent keeps
(frpc.toml). The agent sets this rcvar itself when a tunnel comes or goes; with the switch off it
does not run.
